tle">Solution</div>
<p id="fs-id1167066072624">The charge of the proton is  <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
 <mrow>
  <mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.60</mn><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup>
   <mrow>
    <mn>10</mn></mrow>
   <mrow>
    <mn>−19</mn></mrow>
  </msup>
  <mtext>C</mtext></mrow>
</mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
  <mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.60</mn><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><mo>×</mo><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup>
   <mrow>
    <mn>10</mn></mrow>
   <mrow>
    <mn>−19</mn></mrow>
  </msup>
  <mtext>C</mtext></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> . Entering this value and the given velocity and magnetic field strength into the equation  <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow>
 <mrow>
  <mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow>
</mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow>
  <mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>  gives</p>
<div data-type="equation" id="fs-id1164564889787"> <math display="block"><semantics><mrow>
 <mrow>
  <mtable>
   <mtr rowalign="center">
    <mtd columnalign="right">
